WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.920
You can edit a file in another terminal while
the agent still remembers an earlier version.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.498
The file changes between turns.

3
00:00:09.498 --> 00:00:14.778
When you ask about it again, Drift adds
this note to the model’s instructions.

4
00:00:14.778 --> 00:00:18.840
The agent re-reads the helper
and sees the updated greeting.

5
00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:36.927
The agent can work from the latest file when the
session knows which old reads need to be refreshed.
